RECOMMENDATIONS:
================
1. ✓ Proceed with edgeR differential analysis
2. ✓ Data quality supports biological interpretation
3. ⚠ 60.8% of loops show positional shifts - buffer approach validated
4. ⚠ Very high correlation suggests limited biological differences
   → May need larger sample size or deeper sequencing to detect subtle changes

